# unit_entries_07: the bank $07 handlers a play enters only by their
# dispatch tables (JMP (table,X)), so no call of their own reaches A5: each
# called directly from a Novice race's state. The pause stages, with the
# timer $0D5F mid-count; the results screen's steps and panels; the race
# phase handlers (countdowns, ready, start timers, lap phases for each
# player, glyph phases, the end window, the paused results, the empty
# handlers). The five that leave the race (PauseStageQuitTaken,
# SoftResetToBootWarm, RaceRestart, RaceEndVideoReset, RaceEndToAttract)
# run as noreturn calls.
load build/stuntracefx/states/novice_coupe_race1.state
call 07:BC32 p=30 db=07 d=0000
load build/stuntracefx/states/novice_coupe_race1.state
set 7E0D5F 05
